Atmosfer di planet ini sedang merebak, Sir.

9
00:00:21.071 --> 00:00:24.404
Reaksi plasmonik intensif memusnahkannya.

10
00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:27.001
Stratosfer sudah berkurang.

11
00:00:27.044 --> 00:00:29.205
Ada ribut radiasi turbulen

12
00:00:29.246 --> 00:00:30.713
